                             "h":  "Welcome to SS2 Literature in English - Third Term",
                             "p":  [
                                       "Welcome to SS2 Literature in English, Third Term. This term is about drama. You learn what makes African drama special, study The Marriage of Anansewa by Efua Sutherland, and then two non-African plays: A Man for All Seasons by Robert Bolt and An Inspector Calls by J. B. Priestley.",
                                       "Plays are written to be performed, so try to read the parts aloud with friends or act a scene. Where small details may differ between editions of a play, the unit tells you to follow your own edition."
